WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.710
The Venus Project.

00:03.190 --> 00:06.480
It is a rare and spectacular project...

00:06.480 --> 00:09.020
...to terraform Venus under the leadership...

00:09.370 --> 00:11.690
...of the Corporation for Planetary Development,

00:11.690 --> 00:13.880
using the over-technology of the visitors.

00:15.200 --> 00:19.250
Venus currently has an atmospheric
cloud plant in place.

00:20.040 --> 00:22.140
The atmospheric
composition is transformed,

00:22.140 --> 00:27.160
and reshaped into an environment
in which carbon-based life is viable.

00:33.840 --> 00:39.270
At the same time, Venus itself is being
moved into the same orbit...

00:39.720 --> 00:44.720
...as the Earth by gravity control
using 12 artificial black holes.

00:45.690 --> 00:47.530
A lot of Neans were born here,

00:47.940 --> 00:49.890
engaging in the terraforming of Venus.

00:50.720 --> 00:52.510
Why would they go so far...

00:52.510 --> 00:56.420
...and for whom is the
new habitable space for?

00:57.050 --> 00:59.870
Nobody ever knows of the true goal behind it all.

01:07.670 --> 01:10.970
METALLIC ROUGE

02:40.710 --> 02:41.720
Come in.

02:43.600 --> 02:45.980
Chairman Yunghart...

02:45.980 --> 02:47.770
Wait, I guess it's Former Chairman now.

02:48.680 --> 02:52.370
With the discovery of
you're using a Proto Nean,

02:52.370 --> 02:55.450
the Protection Bureau requested
the disbanding of the Ministry of Truth.

02:55.740 --> 02:59.800
Even someone from the Department of
Divinities like me can't overturn the decision.

03:00.940 --> 03:04.050
The Protection Bureau has been
wanting to directly negotiate...

03:04.050 --> 03:07.710
...with the visitors, without going
through the Ministry of Truth.

03:08.250 --> 03:10.900
This is a good reason for it.

03:11.590 --> 03:14.170
So, was it you who leaked it?

03:16.280 --> 03:17.990
You're so special,

03:17.990 --> 03:20.850
hence I've also predicted such a risk.

03:21.130 --> 03:22.850
Even so, you chose me?

03:23.400 --> 03:26.850
I welcomed you as my subordinate,
and put you with Rouge.

03:26.850 --> 03:29.570
So, what's your question?

03:29.570 --> 03:34.190
Well, to be frank, I happened to meet
with the moving carnival.

03:34.750 --> 03:37.530
And also that puppeteer you've
been secretly investigating.

03:37.930 --> 03:39.500
So who's the guy?

03:40.440 --> 03:42.620
I'm still investigating.

03:42.620 --> 03:45.240
I had my agent go after him,

03:45.240 --> 03:47.460
but I lost him around Ceres.

03:47.950 --> 03:49.340
The usurpers?

03:49.340 --> 03:51.920
or maybe a human working with them?

03:52.380 --> 03:55.320
Maybe they're linking up with
the usurpers in the inviolable line...

03:55.320 --> 03:57.930
Sikes! They might actually go here.

03:58.680 --> 04:00.300
The Venus Project...

04:00.810 --> 04:03.440
There is also a black reactor on Venus...

04:03.440 --> 04:05.890
...that generates micro
black holes for this purpose.

04:06.210 --> 04:09.480
Not to mention, the place is
the largest Nean production base.

04:09.960 --> 04:13.070
That would complicate things, then.

04:13.630 --> 04:16.070
Looks like the gears are starting to slip off.

04:16.630 --> 04:19.560
We need to adjust them before
they really slip off.

04:19.560 --> 04:23.040
The puppeteer was messing with Rouge's memories.

04:23.040 --> 04:27.870
Hey, there's still something you're
hiding from us about her, right?

04:29.070 --> 04:32.960
Anyway, since her true
identity has come to light,

04:33.230 --> 04:35.900
Rouge Redstar will be transferred
to the Protection Bureau,

04:35.900 --> 04:38.400
and will receive appropriate punishment there.

04:40.220 --> 04:42.050
Appropriate punishment...

04:42.050 --> 04:44.120
You people really like the phrase.

04:44.510 --> 04:46.580
Appropriate punishment, my ass!

04:47.380 --> 04:50.380
How could they remove me
from the Yunghart case!

04:50.380 --> 04:52.860
They must be under pressure from someone...

04:52.860 --> 04:54.780
There are numerous precedents...

04:54.780 --> 04:57.440
...for submitting false documents,
and disciplinary action...

04:57.450 --> 04:59.480
...against unauthorised searches.

04:59.480 --> 05:02.070
This punishment is very appropriate and proper.

05:02.070 --> 05:03.990
Whose side are you on?

05:04.380 --> 05:05.620
Of course, yours.

05:08.090 --> 05:09.540
So, where are we going now?

05:09.540 --> 05:10.710
The Ministry of Truth.

05:11.100 --> 05:13.720
The red suspect has been apprehended.

05:13.720 --> 05:15.520
Like hell I'm staying still.

05:15.890 --> 05:18.340
We're not the gears of an organisation.

05:18.340 --> 05:22.460
So Rouge Redstar was really the red suspect?

05:22.460 --> 05:25.080
Yeah, I saw with my own eyes.

05:25.080 --> 05:28.670
But they are now under the
watchful eye of the Protection Bureau.

05:29.040 --> 05:31.100
I don't think they will cooperate.

05:31.780 --> 05:33.990
Besides, we're already off the case...

05:33.990 --> 05:36.650
Who cares? We go from the front.

05:36.650 --> 05:38.940
We'll figure it out if we go there.

05:40.420 --> 05:41.850
Always so rough, aren't you?

05:41.850 --> 05:44.340
Can't you stop yapping for a sec?

05:44.340 --> 05:46.430
This is why I hate Neans.

05:53.760 --> 05:56.750
I really need some
Nectar than chocolate now...

05:58.170 --> 06:02.800
This is a violation of Article 5 of
the Artificial Species Operational Regulations.

06:03.450 --> 06:07.350
We have acknowledged that
this was Jean Yunghart's own decision.

06:07.350 --> 06:09.500
Your leadership as the head of the Ministry...

06:09.500 --> 06:12.020
...is also being questioned,
and at the same time,

06:12.320 --> 06:14.460
the Ministry, without a search warrant,

06:14.460 --> 06:17.270
is truly abusing their legal authority.

06:17.690 --> 06:19.400
I understand.

06:19.400 --> 06:22.530
So, what will the Protection Bureau do with us?

06:23.100 --> 06:25.950
The proposal for dissolution
is already submitted...

06:25.950 --> 06:28.650
...to the Commission for
the Welfare of Artificial Species.

06:28.650 --> 06:32.040
That also means you
will be relieved of your duty,

06:32.410 --> 06:33.780
Chief Chau.

06:33.780 --> 06:34.790
Unfortunately,

06:35.080 --> 06:37.410
without the Department
of Divinities' authorisation,

06:37.410 --> 06:39.440
the Commission cannot accept the submission.

06:39.440 --> 06:40.960
But...

06:40.960 --> 06:43.840
Only the Department of Divinities
have the right to accept it.

06:44.730 --> 06:47.020
That means, I have the right.

06:48.000 --> 06:52.760
I assume you are the managing
director of PanaCare, Herman Heyward?

06:52.760 --> 06:55.060
What is a civilian like you doing here?

06:55.390 --> 06:56.970
We want his cooperation...

06:56.970 --> 07:00.660
...for the Proto Nean, Rouge Redstar's case.

07:00.660 --> 07:03.680
After all, she could deform...

07:03.680 --> 07:06.570
...into battle form, just like the Immortal.

07:06.570 --> 07:08.200
What's she called?

07:08.200 --> 07:09.780
I think it's...

07:09.780 --> 07:13.080
Codename: Metal Rouge?

07:13.370 --> 07:15.880
She's an extremely precious sample.

07:15.880 --> 07:18.040
Hence, our company
would like to disassemble her,

07:18.040 --> 07:20.460
and conduct thorough research on her.

07:20.460 --> 07:24.640
On top of that, we will
take responsibility, and handle her.

07:24.640 --> 07:28.620
Rouge Redstar is currently under
the management of the Ministry of Truth.

07:28.620 --> 07:32.100
Without formal paperwork,
we cannot handle her to you yet.

07:32.100 --> 07:35.230
You say "management" so easily,

07:35.660 --> 07:40.940
but there's no way an organisation who violated
the law could keep such a dangerous being!

07:41.330 --> 07:45.390
I'll decide whether or not she is dangerous.

07:45.390 --> 07:47.000
And not you.

07:47.000 --> 07:50.700
You haven't seen her in action, after all!

07:51.220 --> 07:53.960
If you see the hole she punched through Sara,

07:53.960 --> 07:54.950
even you will...

07:54.950 --> 07:57.640
By Sara, do you mean Sara Fitzgerald...

07:57.640 --> 08:01.840
...a.k.a. Viola of the
Purgatory, one of the Immortal Nine?

08:01.840 --> 08:04.700
Were you in deep relationship with her?

08:07.300 --> 08:08.910
You may take your leave now.

08:33.630 --> 08:35.830
The Nectar's almost running out now.

08:36.820 --> 08:39.159
Should we ask the top to administer it again?

08:40.390 --> 08:41.720
Hey, what's happening here?!

08:41.720 --> 08:42.679
Get it checked out!

08:42.679 --> 08:43.840
O-Okay!

09:12.000 --> 09:13.730
Now, let's get out of here.

09:15.060 --> 09:17.570
Huh...? Jill's in front of me...

09:17.570 --> 09:18.750
Is this an illusion?

09:19.080 --> 09:20.340
I'm the real deal.

09:20.880 --> 09:22.280
How did you get here?

09:22.280 --> 09:24.710
A Nean friend guided me.

09:25.320 --> 09:28.530
The real Jill is friends with a Nean?

09:28.530 --> 09:30.470
I mean, I'm also a Nean.

09:31.010 --> 09:33.750
Jill... the Nean?

09:35.250 --> 09:37.510
Your favourite food, no?
Want some?

09:39.550 --> 09:42.020
Even though you had a shot to escape...

09:42.590 --> 09:45.020
But why did you not resist?

09:49.740 --> 09:50.650
This way.

09:52.040 --> 09:55.160
Who are you really?

10:00.040 --> 10:01.790
Where are we?

10:02.230 --> 10:03.450
What is this place?

10:04.070 --> 10:08.050
This is where the Neans considered to
be dangerous were brought in.

10:08.510 --> 10:11.760
One was destined to be disassembled,
and the other...

10:12.920 --> 10:14.670
Everyone's so beautiful.

10:16.120 --> 10:18.840
Humans who have committed
crimes are brought to justice.

10:19.480 --> 10:22.770
But we are destined to arbitrary punishments.

10:23.370 --> 10:25.790
Even though we were just trying to live freely.

10:26.910 --> 10:29.660
So, you're also an Immortal Nine?

10:32.100 --> 10:33.110
Nice face you've got.

10:33.110 --> 10:35.230
Why did you save me?

10:35.230 --> 10:36.800
Because I need you.

10:37.570 --> 10:41.290
We Altar are fighting to free Neans.

10:41.950 --> 10:43.020
Free?

10:43.360 --> 10:46.000
From the Azimov Code,
from the Nectar...

10:46.590 --> 10:48.640
And also from the human's curse.

10:48.640 --> 10:49.840
I told you already, no?

10:50.490 --> 10:52.630
That you must choose to be free yourself.

10:52.630 --> 10:55.390
The Azimov Code cannot be erased.

10:55.390 --> 10:56.720
There's no way Neans can be...

10:56.720 --> 10:57.710
We can free them.

10:58.230 --> 10:59.840
YOU can free them.

11:00.220 --> 11:00.920
Huh?

11:01.300 --> 11:02.440
Poor thing.

11:02.880 --> 11:06.490
I assume Jean never
told you about yourself?

11:07.160 --> 11:08.170
Jean...

11:08.790 --> 11:10.700
What my brother said to me...

11:10.700 --> 11:15.610
Your brother, Jean Yunghart, was fired
from the Ministry of Truth.

11:16.620 --> 11:20.300
Both you and your brother
are gears of the organisation.

11:20.300 --> 11:21.830
When they don't match,

11:21.830 --> 11:25.250
they will be replaced and thrown away.

11:25.840 --> 11:26.760
So...

11:31.880 --> 11:34.170
The apprehended
Proto Nean is on the loose?

11:34.800 --> 11:37.800
Fenrir Squad, go after
the runaway Rouge Redstar.

11:40.500 --> 11:43.620
They're the dogs of war, loyal to me.

11:43.930 --> 11:46.940
#7 APPROPRIATE GEAR

11:47.750 --> 11:49.570
Time to go for broke!

11:51.150 --> 11:52.690
And it broke.

11:54.860 --> 11:56.760
Warning, warning.

11:56.760 --> 11:58.780
Trespassers at Gate 7B.

11:58.780 --> 12:01.240
All guards to the scene at once.

12:01.240 --> 12:03.080
Repeat, repeat.

12:03.480 --> 12:05.120
Warning, warning.

12:05.120 --> 12:07.340
- Trespassers at Gate 7B.
- This way!

12:07.340 --> 12:09.500
All guards to the scene at once.

12:09.940 --> 12:11.960
Repeat, repeat.

12:12.400 --> 12:16.140
Warning, warning.
Trespassers at Gate 7B.

12:16.140 --> 12:18.530
All guards to the scene at once.

12:26.350 --> 12:27.270
My bad.

12:27.880 --> 12:28.880
It's okay.

12:29.750 --> 12:31.200
This is my...

12:31.660 --> 12:34.530
...own decision...

12:35.160 --> 12:38.240
A Nean cannot cause harm to humans.

12:38.610 --> 12:42.550
Nor they can overlook
the harm done to humans.

12:43.890 --> 12:44.660
Yes...

12:46.000 --> 12:48.520
This is death by Azimov Code.

12:49.820 --> 12:51.420
This is what they, as our creators...

12:52.230 --> 12:55.170
What they, the humans,
have bestowed upon us.

12:56.030 --> 12:57.400
How vile.

12:58.280 --> 13:00.010
O sinful creators!

13:00.700 --> 13:02.470
Woe to humans!

13:08.240 --> 13:10.530
Rather than collecting fellow Nean's id,

13:10.530 --> 13:13.040
I had him prioritise you...

13:13.040 --> 13:15.020
But it seems that I was too naive.

13:21.410 --> 13:24.950
Who would've thought some mercenary
cyborgs would greet me...

13:25.750 --> 13:27.080
How petty of them!

13:28.600 --> 13:29.400
Rouge!

13:32.520 --> 13:33.540
Naomi!

13:35.730 --> 13:37.280
Why?!

13:38.050 --> 13:40.870
There she is! See, she really is...

13:49.810 --> 13:50.680
Rouge.

13:51.020 --> 13:53.520
Why do we, with this great power,

13:53.890 --> 13:57.270
have to be slaves to humans?

14:03.600 --> 14:04.990
Sylvia of the Flash!

14:09.560 --> 14:12.750
If we can't walk with them,
then we'll destroy them!

14:44.980 --> 14:46.820
Even the Arcos of the Twin Heads is here...

14:47.380 --> 14:49.490
Hey, blockhead! We're going now!

15:08.890 --> 15:09.970
Target lost.

15:09.970 --> 15:11.040
Go check for them now.

15:11.040 --> 15:12.140
Rescue the wounded!

15:12.880 --> 15:14.210
The gears...

15:14.820 --> 15:15.850
...are slipping off...

15:19.260 --> 15:22.690
You're also a Proto Nean,
an Immortal Nine, right?

15:23.000 --> 15:23.870
So why?

15:23.870 --> 15:25.570
Freeze.

15:26.050 --> 15:29.200
Sheesh, we have the red one,
and the black one...

15:29.560 --> 15:31.910
We also have the golden one,

15:31.910 --> 15:34.600
and now an orange one?

15:37.190 --> 15:39.900
A kid? You're kidding me.

15:39.900 --> 15:41.130
Comparing data.

15:41.810 --> 15:45.340
I saw their name on the passenger
manifest of the liaison ship from Mars.

15:45.340 --> 15:48.440
Is it really you, Aes?

15:48.440 --> 15:50.820
You want me to gouge your eyes?

15:50.820 --> 15:52.600
Huh? Alice?

15:53.000 --> 15:54.780
Telling me to go save her...

15:54.780 --> 15:57.550
Aes sure is an easygoing one.

15:57.550 --> 16:00.080
You won't be able to be of use to us,

16:00.080 --> 16:03.980
just like a stranded cat in an old rag...

16:04.660 --> 16:08.260
Ah! Sorry for the rude things Alice said!

16:08.260 --> 16:10.910
So Aes is Alice, and Alice is Aes?!

16:11.170 --> 16:11.940
Umm...

16:11.940 --> 16:14.350
It appears to be similar
to personality switching...

16:14.350 --> 16:15.920
...in dissociative identity disorder.

16:15.920 --> 16:17.500
Explain like I'm five.

16:17.500 --> 16:19.120
It's multiple personalities.

16:19.120 --> 16:20.290
Hmm...

16:26.040 --> 16:27.930
Rouge's secret...

16:29.740 --> 16:33.430
Found corrupted data within
Yunghart Residence's security backup.

16:34.160 --> 16:35.320
Yung Residence?

16:35.690 --> 16:37.890
Security cameras, show history.

16:57.100 --> 16:58.800
Here is the thing you requested.

17:00.990 --> 17:04.430
Seems like Rouge Redstar has escaped
from the Ministry of Truth.

17:05.040 --> 17:06.119
I see.

17:06.720 --> 17:08.280
What will you do now?

17:08.910 --> 17:11.960
Of course, to adjust the gears...

17:38.560 --> 17:39.940
Stare...

17:41.320 --> 17:43.520
If you have something in mind, spill it.

17:43.520 --> 17:45.670
I told you to limit your smoking...

17:45.670 --> 17:47.640
I mean, don't say anything!

17:50.650 --> 17:53.870
Why would an Immortal Nine like you...

17:53.870 --> 17:55.720
...go and save me?

17:56.160 --> 17:59.610
We've always been on the run from Sylphia.

17:59.960 --> 18:01.600
Alice is the more skillful one,

18:01.600 --> 18:04.980
and always gathers intel and
things needed for our survival.

18:05.720 --> 18:08.860
Thanks to her, we could always escape danger.

18:09.390 --> 18:13.930
It was also Alice who caught wind that more
and more of the Immortal Nine...

18:13.930 --> 18:15.050
...were killed.

18:15.510 --> 18:18.240
Thus, she found out about you,
and we approached you.

18:19.550 --> 18:21.930
By the way, I was against it.

18:22.680 --> 18:24.750
What do you want me to do?

18:25.610 --> 18:28.160
We are different from the other Immortal Nine.

18:28.610 --> 18:30.760
We just want to live normally.

18:31.240 --> 18:31.920
Rouge...

18:32.450 --> 18:34.850
Why do you have to kill us?

18:35.580 --> 18:36.890
It's my mission.

18:37.410 --> 18:40.430
So you'll kill anyone under orders,
no questions asked?

18:40.920 --> 18:43.340
Jean told me you're dangerous...

18:43.340 --> 18:45.150
But we're not dangerous!

18:46.140 --> 18:48.870
She's just an assassin
without a thought for herself.

18:48.870 --> 18:50.280
No use talking sense to her.

18:50.830 --> 18:54.150
Never mind Aes, I think Alice is a bad guy.

18:54.500 --> 18:58.340
Right. I'm not as weak as Aes, after all.

18:59.960 --> 19:03.490
So you never question your orders?

19:03.490 --> 19:06.750
Jean would never order something wrong to me.

19:07.090 --> 19:09.640
Jean this, Jean that...

19:09.640 --> 19:12.430
How can you tell he's not wrong?

19:13.510 --> 19:15.570
What do you think yourself?

19:18.200 --> 19:21.280
Are you the good guys, or the bad guys?

19:21.700 --> 19:24.680
Are you a good guy for trying to kill us?

19:25.160 --> 19:26.500
I...

19:27.640 --> 19:30.220
Affirmed. You are a bad guy.

19:30.220 --> 19:32.530
I'm not! I'm a good guy!

19:32.530 --> 19:35.450
So the guy coming to kill us is a good guy?

19:37.000 --> 19:40.910
To us, you are definitely a bad guy.

19:41.370 --> 19:42.830
You should get it already, Aes.

19:42.830 --> 19:46.420
That we are idiots for trying to rely on her.

19:49.270 --> 19:50.480
H-Hey.

19:52.210 --> 19:55.550
See you, self-proclaimed good guy.

19:57.330 --> 20:00.690
You really are bad with people.

20:03.490 --> 20:04.810
I see.

20:05.390 --> 20:09.770
So one of the Immortal Nine
killed Roy Yunghart?

20:10.240 --> 20:11.980
Jean said so.

20:14.360 --> 20:17.490
We were investigating the Yunghart case.

20:18.210 --> 20:19.930
With this footage as a clue,

20:19.930 --> 20:23.350
I had been after you as the red suspect.

20:24.310 --> 20:26.020
That's not me.

20:26.020 --> 20:27.430
Must be the camouflaging Nean...

20:27.430 --> 20:29.900
...we met at the liaison ship.

20:29.900 --> 20:32.130
Right! It's Jaron!

20:32.600 --> 20:34.620
He mentioned it himself that he did it!

20:35.050 --> 20:39.510
But what would the Immortal
Nine kill Yunghart for?

20:40.270 --> 20:42.720
I already offed Jaron...

20:42.720 --> 20:44.950
Dead men tell no tales.

21:07.000 --> 21:09.430
I thought I was done for...

21:11.960 --> 21:14.050
You could've just died, though.

21:15.310 --> 21:18.320
Long time no see, Graufon.
